{"unit_id": "tag:07ZG:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为一个概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>、<MATH_0003>是两个分次（graded）拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0004>-代数（algebras）。令<MATH_0005>和<MATH_0006>。设<MATH_0007>是分次（graded）<MATH_0008>-代数（algebras）之间的一个同态（homomorphism）。存在一个典范（canonical）的开子集（open）<MATH_0009>、一个典范态射（canonical morphism）<MATH_0010>（在<MATH_0011>上的概形（schemes）之间），以及<MATH_0012>-分次（graded）<MATH_0013>-代数（algebras）之间的一个映射（map）<MATH_0014>。三元组（triple）<MATH_0015>由下述性质（property）刻画：对于任意仿射开子集（affine open）<MATH_0016>，三元组（triple）<MATH_0017>等于与<MATH_0018>相对应的三元组（triple）（该对应见引理<REF_0001>），其中所用的等同（identifications）<MATH_0019>和<MATH_0020>来自第<REF_0002>节。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "homomorphism", "target_term": "同态"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开子集"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "triple", "target_term": "三元组"}, {"source_term": "property", "target_term": "性质"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开子集"}, {"source_term": "triple", "target_term": "三元组"}, {"source_term": "triple", "target_term": "三元组"}, {"source_term": "identifications", "target_term": "等同"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引理所设定的基概形。"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "修饰最初给定的两个代数。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "修饰最初给定的两个代数。"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数", "context": "最初给定的两个分次拟凝聚代数。"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "修饰给定同态两端的代数。"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数", "context": "给定同态两端的代数。"}, {"source_term": "homomorphism", "target_term": "同态", "context": "给定的分次代数同态。"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范", "context": "修饰引理所给出的开子集。"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开子集", "context": "引理所给出的典范开子集。"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射", "context": "引理给出的基概形上的态射。"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "典范态射两端的概形。"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "修饰所构造映射两端带有指定分次的代数。"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数", "context": "所构造映射两端的代数。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "引理所给出的分次代数之间的映射。"}, {"source_term": "triple", "target_term": "三元组", "context": "由局部条件刻画的三元组。"}, {"source_term": "property", "target_term": "性质", "context": "用于刻画三元组的条件。"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开子集", "context": "三元组局部刻画中的任意仿射开子集。"}, {"source_term": "triple", "target_term": "三元组", "context": "任一仿射开子集上参与比较的三元组。"}, {"source_term": "triple", "target_term": "三元组", "context": "由引用引理给出的对应三元组。"}, {"source_term": "identifications", "target_term": "等同", "context": "比较局部三元组时使用的两项等同。"}], "notes": []}
